script = ExtResource("1_wxsou")
dialogue_id = "debate_talisman_bead"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Talismans"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: Many people today look at our customs as thoughtless imitation.
scribe: They think we are children following arbitrary rules.
scribe: But let us examine the humble charcoal beads that so many of us wear.
scribe: Generations ago, the Enlightened One instructed our ancestors to press these beads from the ashes of old fires.
scribe: For centuries, we have worn them as a symbol of humility, a reminder of the world we lost.
scribe: Recently, our scholars and healers have begun to study the hidden properties of ash and charcoal.
scribe: They have discovered that charcoal naturally draws out impurities, filtering the rot from stagnant water and absorbing poisons from the body.
scribe: Now we know that the charcoal dust that drops from the beads into our food helps us survive illnesses.
scribe: We never needed to understand why the beads were important to benefit from them.
scribe: We can study the world to comprehend the machinery of miracles, without rejecting the ones we cannot yet explain.
scribe: Faith is the candle we carry to push away the dark, until our knowledge is bright enough to dispel it."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
